    <footnotes>
        <footnote id="F1">On April 2, 2026, a trust (the &quot;Trust&quot;) for the benefit of the reporting person's spouse and children elected to convert a portion of its shares of the issuer's Series A Non-Voting Convertible Preferred Stock into shares of the issuer's common stock. The remaining shares of the issuer's Series A Non-Voting Convertible Preferred Stock held by the Trust are subject to a beneficial ownership limitation.</footnote>
