        <footnote id="F3">On November 13, 2023, the issuer acquired the private Delaware corporation which was then known as Cartesian Therapeutics, Inc. in accordance with the terms of an Agreement and Plan of Merger, dated November 13, 2023 (the &quot;Merger&quot;). These securities represent merger consideration payable as a result of the closing of the Merger and securities purchased in a private placement in November 2023.</footnote>
